01:10:58,990 --> 01:11:01,600
智能体可以与这个局部变量进行交互。
that the agent can interact with this local variable.

1257
01:11:02,080 --> 01:11:05,373
我们正在使用 CopilotKit 提供的 useFrontendTool hook，
We're using the useFrontendTool hook provided by CopilotKit,

1258
01:11:05,373 --> 01:11:07,920
它连接到 AG-UI 的前端工具概念。
which connects to AG-UI's frontend tool concept.

1259
01:11:08,240 --> 01:11:13,609
就像其他所有工具一样，这个前端工具可以提供名称、描述，
And just like every other tool, this frontend tool can provide a name, a description,

1260
01:11:13,609 --> 01:11:16,710
以及同样被指定为 Zod schema 的参数。
parameters specified once again as a Zod schema.

1261
01:11:17,190 --> 01:11:20,870
提醒一下，Zod 相当于 TypeScript 版的 Pydantic。
As a reminder, Zod is the TypeScript equivalent of Pydantic.

1262
01:11:21,030 --> 01:11:24,570
最后，我们的前端工具可以有一个处理函数，它将被执行
And finally, our frontend tool can have a handler that will be executed

1263
01:11:24,570 --> 01:11:27,390
当智能体决定在前端调用此工具时。
when the agent decides to call this tool on the frontend.

1264
01:11:27,790 --> 01:11:30,710
请注意，前端处理函数在底层可以是异步的。
Notice that the frontend handler can be asynchronous under the hood.

1265
01:11:30,790 --> 01:11:33,600
每当智能体决定调用前端工具时，
Whenever an agent decides to call a frontend tool,

1266
01:11:33,600 --> 01:11:38,550
AG-UI 中间件会将执行权从智能体后端移交给智能体前端。
the AG-UI Middleware hands off execution from the agentic backend to the agentic frontend.

1267
01:11:38,750 --> 01:11:40,786
一旦前端提供了结果，
Once a result is provided by the front end,

1268
01:11:40,786 --> 01:11:44,510
它就会被传回智能体后端，智能体循环继续执行。
it is propagated back to the agentic back end and the agentic loop continues.

1269
01:11:44,990 --> 01:11:47,753
回顾一下我们在这里所做的，我们创建了一个局部变量，
To recap what we did here, we created a local variable

1270
01:11:47,753 --> 01:11:50,390
允许应用打开一个 Todos 面板。
that allows the application to open a Todos panel.

1271
01:11:50,590 --> 01:11:52,696
最初，这个 Todos 面板设为 false，
Initially, this Todos panel is set to false

1272
01:11:52,696 --> 01:11:56,556
并且我们通过一个专门的
and we give the agent the ability to interact with this variable via a dedicated

1273
01:11:56,556 --> 01:11:57,550
前端工具调用，赋予智能体与该变量交互的能力。
front end tool call.

1274
01:11:57,870 --> 01:12:01,280
现在我们将使用 useAgent Hook 来订阅智能体状态。
Now we're going to subscribe to our agent state using the useAgent Hook.

1275
01:12:01,920 --> 01:12:06,291
useAgent 是智能体时代极其强大的原语。在前端，
useAgent is an incredibly powerful primitive for the agentic age. On the front end,

1276
01:12:06,291 --> 01:12:08,040
它为你提供了所需的一切，
it gives you everything you need.

1277
01:12:08,120 --> 01:12:11,919
用于在前端与智能体交互，同时所有繁琐的细节
On the front end in order to interact with agents with all of the messy details

1278
01:12:11,919 --> 01:12:13,640
都会自动为你处理妥当。
automatically taken care for you.

1279
01:12:13,960 --> 01:12:17,990
在这里，我们将使用 useAgent 的状态变量，以便
In this case, we're going to be using useAgent's state variable in order to

1280
01:12:17,990 --> 01:12:21,240
将我们的前端状态与智能体状态双向绑定。
bidirectionally tie our front end state to the agent state.

1281
01:12:21,680 --> 01:12:24,720
最后，我们返回与此应用关联的 React 组件。
Finally, we're returning the React component associated with this application.

1282
01:12:24,800 --> 01:12:29,114
现在我想指出的最重要部分是 Todos 列表
Now the most important part I would like to point out here is the Todos list

1283
01:12:29,114 --> 01:12:33,640
组件，它接受一个状态获取器和一个状态设置器来管理自己的 Todos。
component, which accepts a state getter and a state setter for its own Todos.

1284
01:12:34,360 --> 01:12:38,331
状态获取器只是读取 Agent State Todos。
The state getter is simply reading Agent State Todos.

1285
01:12:38,331 --> 01:12:42,920
状态设置器只是用新的 Todos 设置 Agent State。
The state setter is simply setting Agent State with new Todos.

1286
01:12:43,340 --> 01:12:44,300
这一点意义深远。
This is quite profound.

1287
01:12:44,980 --> 01:12:48,320
我们在这里看到，useAgent Hook 为我们提供了功能完整的状态
We see here that the useAgent Hook provides us with full featured state

1288
01:12:48,320 --> 01:12:50,980
前后端同步。
synchronization between our front end and our back end.

1289
01:12:51,260 --> 01:12:54,243
就像标准的本地 React 状态一样，该状态是响应式的，
Just like local standard React state, the state is reactive,

1290
01:12:54,243 --> 01:12:56,700
我们可以在应用中利用这一点。
which we can take advantage of in our application.

1291
01:12:57,140 --> 01:12:59,524
并且每一次状态更新、流式传输
And every act of state update, streaming

1292
01:12:59,524 --> 01:13:02,540
和上下文解析都会被自动处理。
and context resolution is automatically handled.

1293
01:13:02,580 --> 01:13:04,432
对我们作为应用开发者来说，
For us as application developers,

1294
01:13:04,432 --> 01:13:06,668
我们可以简单地将其视为标准状态，
we can simply treat it as standard state as

1295
01:13:06,668 --> 01:13:11,139
就好像它只是在本地应用中定义一样。而在底层，它会自动保持
if it was just defined in our local application. Under the hood, it is automatically kept

1296
01:13:11,139 --> 01:13:12,800
与我们的智能体后端同步。
in sync with our agentic back end.

1297
01:13:13,600 --> 01:13:14,840
好了，我们来试一下。
All right, let's give it a try.

1298
01:13:14,960 --> 01:13:18,800
我们将再次使用 Display App Helper 来内联显示我们的应用。
Once again, we're going to use the Display App Helper to display our application in line.

1299
01:13:19,280 --> 01:13:22,400
好的。你看，我们现在有一个带有新 Todos 按钮的聊天界面。
All right. You see here we have now a chat with a new Todos button.

1300
01:13:22,480 --> 01:13:23,600
让我们点击它看看会发生什么。
Let's click it to see what happens.

1301
01:13:24,000 --> 01:13:27,400
当我们点击它时，会看到一个包含 Todos 的面板从侧面打开。
When we click it, we see a panel opening from the side with Todos.

1302
01:13:27,520 --> 01:13:29,560
目前还没有定义任何 Todos。
Right now, there are no Todos defined as of yet.

1303
01:13:29,930 --> 01:13:33,130
如果我们想的话，可以在底层本地与其进行交互。
If we wanted to, we could interact with this locally under the hood.

1304
01:13:33,210 --> 01:13:35,432
记住，每次我们这样做时，
Remember, every time we do this,

1305
01:13:35,432 --> 01:13:38,807
智能体状态都会更新，我们也可以关闭它，
the agent state is updated and we can also close it

1306
01:13:38,807 --> 01:13:41,770
让我们的智能体代为编辑 Todos。
and allow our agent to edit our Todos for us.

1307
01:13:42,290 --> 01:13:46,250
记住，智能体也可以设置 Todos 的 open 变量，
Remember the agent can also set the Todos open variable

1308
01:13:46,250 --> 01:13:50,210
该变量决定了 Todos 面板是打开还是关闭。
that decides whether the Todos panel is open or closed.

1309
01:13:50,710 --> 01:13:53,726
让我们要求智能体将 Todos 设置为打开，
Let's ask our agent to set the Todos to open

1310
01:13:53,726 --> 01:13:56,910
并创建一些有趣的 Todos。
and to create a number of interesting Todos.

1311
01:13:57,470 --> 01:13:58,550
好了，就是这样。
All right, there you have it.

1312
01:13:58,870 --> 01:14:03,310
我们的智能体现在打开了 Todos 面板，并用全新数据填充了它。
We now had our agent open our Todos panel and populate it with brand new data.

1313
01:14:03,510 --> 01:14:05,550
这种状态同步是双向的。
This state synchronization works in both directions.

1314
01:14:05,910 --> 01:14:10,090
我们可以编辑 Todos，并询问智能体还有多少 Todos 处于打开状态，
We can edit our Todos and ask our agent how many Todos are still open

1315
01:14:10,090 --> 01:14:11,630
从而获得正确的答案。
and get a correct answer.

1316
01:14:12,130 --> 01:14:15,042
恭喜你，你现在掌握了前端工具调用
Congratulations, you've now mastered front end tool calling

1317
01:14:15,042 --> 01:14:19,410
和状态同步，这是在你之前掌握的完整生成式 UI 光谱基础上的。
and state synchronization in addition to the full Generative UI spectrum you've mastered before.

1318
01:14:20,210 --> 01:14:22,290
我非常期待看到你们将构建出什么。
I'm extremely excited to see what you'll all be building.

1319
01:14:22,970 --> 01:14:27,250
我们在总结部分见。快速回顾一下，恭喜大家。
See you in the conclusion section. For a quick recap, congratulations.

1320
01:14:27,770 --> 01:14:31,034
你现在已经跨越了整个生成式 UI 光谱进行了构建。
You've now built across the entire generative UI spectrum.

1321
01:14:31,034 --> 01:14:33,450
你从受控的生成式 UI 开始。
You started with controlled generative UI.

1322
01:14:34,310 --> 01:14:38,150
作为程序员，你对每一个组件都有完全的控制权。
Where you as the programmer had full control over every single component.

1323
01:14:38,430 --> 01:14:40,886
接着你过渡到了声明式的生成式 UI，
You then moved to declarative, generative UI,

1324
01:14:40,886 --> 01:14:44,790
你定义了积木式组件，智能体可以按需将它们组合起来。
where you define building blocks that the agent could assemble on demand.

1325
01:14:45,070 --> 01:14:48,306
然后你将智能体连接到了第三方 MCP Apps，
You then connected your agent to third-party MCP apps

1326
01:14:48,306 --> 01:14:51,541
甚至探索了完全开放式的生成式 UI，
and you even explored fully open-ended generative UI

1327
01:14:51,541 --> 01:14:54,630
智能体可以在其中从零开始创建界面。
where the agent creates interfaces from scratch.

1328
01:14:55,070 --> 01:14:58,721
最后，你构建了一个共享状态应用，智能体
Finally, you built a shared state application where the agent

1329
01:14:58,721 --> 01:15:01,880
与聊天窗口之外的前端状态保持同步。
and the frontend state are in sync beyond the chat window.

1330
01:15:02,160 --> 01:15:05,975
核心要点是：没有一种方法能解决所有问题，
The key takeaway is this, there is no one approach to rule them all,

1331
01:15:05,975 --> 01:15:09,720
生成式 UI 光谱的每个部分都服务于不同的需求。
each part of the generative UI spectrum serves a different need.

1332
01:15:10,080 --> 01:15:13,640
现在你拥有了在自己的应用中混合搭配这些方法的工具。
And now you have the tools to mix and match those in your own applications.

1333
01:15:14,040 --> 01:15:18,203
并且因为你构建的所有内容都使用了开源的 AG-UI 协议，
And because everything you built uses the open-source AG-UI protocol,

1334
01:15:18,203 --> 01:15:23,370
这些模式可以在整个智能体生态系统中通用，而不仅限于 CopilotKit 内部。
these patterns work across the entire agentic ecosystem, not just within CopilotKit.

1335
