到洞察层，它让你能了解用户
to the insight layer that allows you to understand how your users are interacting

1338
01:15:36,331 --> 01:15:38,090
在生产环境中如何与你的智能体交互。
with your agents in production.

1339
01:15:38,290 --> 01:15:40,542
再到自我改进层，
All the way to the self-improvement layer,

1340
01:15:40,542 --> 01:15:43,437
它允许你的智能体在多次交互中学习，
that allows your agents to learn across interactions

1341
01:15:43,437 --> 01:15:47,490
